From 478e3912dbe4ca1afb542d933df306a44c6542fc Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: heresy <heresy@local>
Date: Wed, 30 Sep 2026 13:58:51 -0600
Subject: [PATCH 1006/1178] Form comfort: title line, folding blocks, growing
 text, changed knobs, clef icon

HERESY 1006.
- The title has its own line at full width; the two seeds share the next one.
- Lyrics sit right under the style prompt.
- Style, Lyrics, VAE, Sliders and LoRAs fold on a click on their heading; a
  folded text block shows its first words. Kept per browser.
- Style grows with its text up to 8 lines, lyrics up to 16, then they scroll.
  The kit's growLyrics now measures through the same fitText.
- A number, range or solver moved off its default gets an amber frame. The
  default is the value attribute the page already writes as the step base.
- Favicon: a treble clef with A4 on the staff, glyphs from Noto Music (OFL).
- vLLM lists only what it serves: the native model probes of the other
  runners are skipped there, and the console has no more 404s from them.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
